# Description:  Python script to modify the regress files
#		with the NSM method. Eliminating the attitude errors.
#		Includes the XX XY XZ YY YZ ZZ observations and reduces
#		the available observation sets to 6 - NS_dim
#		The amount of meas used are specified as 1 and 0s array. EX: 100101 (diag meas)
#		The eigenvalues of the NS are selcted with 1 and 0's array. EX:010 (second eigVal for diag. meas set)
#		NOTE: this version runs in lonestar6 (run_nsm.job)
#		NOTE: to run the script in the local machine (launch_NSM_regres_local.sh) 
#       NOTE: includes the measurement scale factor as an input
